Z||000000||Phil||07-05-2001||07:49 PM||||Finished up the wife's T-top coupe today and spent about 2 hrs. at the Dept. of Motor Vehicles getting it registered. I finally got home put the plates on, fired up the freshly rebuilt "mighty" iron duke and went for a test drive. I figured that there would be a difference twixt the SC3800 and the Duke and I was far from being dissapointed. The loss of approximately 185 HP is more than noticeable, kinda like the difference between ice crean and stones. Good thing the wife is more interested in the open top than performance.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_1.gif">  <BR>SC 3800||||reg||1
